2024-10-19 22:18:56,116 - INFO - Data To transform : [['Lucifer Morningstar', 'Look, people like you. they find you helpful, like duct tape or a trusty socket wrench.'], ['Chloe Decker', "It's really not a good day for…your…Luciferness."], ['Chloe Decker', "Why don't you tell me something? How did she end up dying in a hailstorm of bullets and you get away without a scratch? I think that's interesting, don't you?"], ['Linda Martin', "I find that people make Los Angeles their home for one of two reasons. Either they're running from something, or looking for something."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "All my time with Dr. Linda has been about exploring the denial that I'm in, but I've overcome that now, I've had an honest-to-Devil epiphany. Now all my problems should just, you know, go away."], ['Ella Lopez', "Whenever I'm procrastinating on something, I make an appointment for myself to do it. That way, can't back out. Like, for example, when I had to ask my landlord permission to get Bob, literally put it on my calendar."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "No, of course not. I detest the little creatures. And I'd certainly never put one in my mouth."], ['Ella Lopez', 'I mean, God works in mysterious ways. So you just got to believe that when He crushes your nuts, He does it for a reason.'], ['Dan Espinoza', "I'm trying to say this from a constructive place. I can feel your negative vibrations from across the room, man."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', 'I am a Devil of my word.'], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "Always gratifying to find out that one's nemesis is altogether lacking in style."], ['Chloe Decker', 'You know, if you spent as much time appealing to suspects as you do annoying me, things might go a lot faster.'], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "No, of course not. I detest the little creatures. And I'd certainly never put one in my mouth."], ['Linda Martin', "There's a good chance this thing might come out of me with wings. Wings!"], ['Ella Lopez', "Whenever I'm procrastinating on something, I make an appointment for myself to do it. That way, can't back out. Like, for example, when I had to ask my landlord permission to get Bob, literally put it on my calendar."], ['Trixie', "My name's Beatrice but everybody calls me Trixie."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', 'As though I wanted people to suffer. All I ever wanted was to be my own man here.'], ['Chloe Decker', 'You know, if you spent as much time appealing to suspects as you do annoying me, things might go a lot faster.'], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "People don't have power over us. We give it to them."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "Well, that is a shame. 'Cause you and my backside used to get on very well."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "Yeah, well, our Father's been disrespecting me since the beginning of time, so pot-kettle, don't you think?"], ['Linda Martin', 'When angels fall, they also… rise.'], ['Dan Espinoza', 'My life imploded because of you. My marriage, my Job, my snacks. I know you ate my pudding. It was labelled!'], ['Eve', 'Anybody worth dating should understand everything that makes you… you.'], ['Linda Martin', "I find that people make Los Angeles their home for one of two reasons. Either they're running from something, or looking for something."], ['Linda Martin', "I find that people make Los Angeles their home for one of two reasons. Either they're running from something, or looking for something."], ['Linda Martin', 'Oh, right. The Eve, from the Garden of Eden. I mean, I am carrying an angel baby. I guess this is just a normal Tuesday for me now.'], ['Ella Lopez', "It's always the ones you least suspect, the ones you trust the most, that hurt you. They wait until your guard is down and then wham! In my case, it was tequila."], ['Ella Lopez', 'I mean, God works in mysterious ways. So you just got to believe that when He crushes your nuts, He does it for a reason.'], ['Lucifer Morningstar', 'You people misunderstand me. You call me Satan and Devil but… do you know my crime? I loved God too much. And for that he betrayed me — punished me.'], ['Father Frank', 'We might not always understand it, but God has a plan.'], ['Dan Espinoza', 'Say you fall in love with a woman who has a cat. What are you gonna do? You accept the cat.'], ['Chloe Decker', 'Lucifer Morningstar. Is that a stage name or something?'], ['Amenadiel', "You sure you don't want to chase after her? Maybe I can ask Father for some rain and make it a moment."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "All my time with Dr. Linda has been about exploring the denial that I'm in, but I've overcome that now, I've had an honest-to-Devil epiphany. Now all my problems should just, you know, go away."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "My mum's gonna kill me. And before you say it, that's not a metaphor. She's literally going to kill me. She's not the forgiving type."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "Lately I've been thinking. Do you think I'm the Devil because I'm inherently evil, or just because dear ol' dad decided I was?"], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "No, of course not. I detest the little creatures. And I'd certainly never put one in my mouth."], ['Dan Espinoza', "No one expects you to change overnight. It's hard to be one of the good guys. Look, I screw up, too. I've made plenty of mistakes believe me. But I don't quit… and I know that counts for something. At least you're trying, right?"], ['Linda Martin', "I find that people make Los Angeles their home for one of two reasons. Either they're running from something, or looking for something."], ['Amenadiel', 'No matter how bad things get, the true test is how we choose to respond to the pain we suffer, or inflict.'], ['Ella Lopez', 'I mean, God works in mysterious ways. So you just got to believe that when He crushes your nuts, He does it for a reason.'], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "Let me play the Me's advocate."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', 'Hell truly hath no fury like a woman scorned.'], ['Lucifer Morningstar', 'That tingling sensation running up your spine… inevitability. And the bit running down your leg? Fear.'], ['Lucifer Morningstar', 'As though I wanted people to suffer. All I ever wanted was to be my own man here.'], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "No, of course not. I detest the little creatures. And I'd certainly never put one in my mouth."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "A deal's a deal, especially one with the Devil."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', "Well, that is a shame. 'Cause you and my backside used to get on very well."], ['Lucifer Morningstar', 'Detective Decker is out there protecting them. She is...truly good.']]
